@startuml 06_submit_report_current_vs_proposed
title Submit Incident Report — Current Behavior vs. Proposed Fix

skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam note {
    BackgroundColor #FFF9C4
    BorderColor #F9A825
}

actor "Reporter (User)" as User
participant "ReportIncidentFragment" as Fragment
participant "ReportIncidentViewModel\n.submitReport()" as VM
participant "WalkSessionRepositoryImpl" as FERepo
participant "ReportController\nPOST /sessions/{id}/report" as Controller
participant "ReportCommandService\n.submitReport()" as ReportSvc
participant "WalkSessionRepository" as SessionRepo
participant "SessionReportRepository" as ReportRepo
participant "UserRepository\n(trust score)" as UserRepo
participant "AiTrainingService\n@Async [CURRENT]" as AiSvcCurrent
participant "MatchingPreferenceRepository" as PrefRepo

== User submits an incident report ==

User -> Fragment : Select reason, optional evidence URL, tap Submit
Fragment -> VM : submitReport(sessionId, reportedUserId, reason, evidenceUrl)
VM -> FERepo : reportSession(sessionId, reportedUserId, reason, evidenceUrl, callback)
FERepo -> Controller : POST /api/v1/sessions/{sessionId}/report\n{reportedUserId, reason, evidenceUrl}

Controller -> ReportSvc : submitReport(sessionId, reporterId,\n  reportedUserId, reason, evidenceUrl)

== Validation (same transaction) ==

ReportSvc -> SessionRepo : findById(sessionId)
SessionRepo --> ReportSvc : WalkSession{status=COMPLETED}
ReportSvc -> ReportSvc : verify status = COMPLETED\nverify reporter is participant\nverify reporter != reportedUser\nverify within 72h window\nverify reporter personal status != NO_SHOW
ReportSvc -> ReportRepo : existsBySessionAndReporter(sessionId, reporterId)
ReportRepo --> ReportSvc : false (no duplicate)

== Apply Trust Penalty on Reported User (same transaction) ==

ReportSvc -> ReportSvc : theoreticalDelta = TrustScorePolicy.deltaForReason(reason)
ReportSvc -> ReportSvc : guard: if reportedUser is NO_SHOW → actualDelta = 0
ReportSvc -> UserRepo : findById(reportedUserId) → reportedUser
UserRepo --> ReportSvc : reportedUser{trustScore}
ReportSvc -> ReportSvc : newScore = TrustScorePolicy.apply(trustScore, actualDelta)
ReportSvc -> UserRepo : save(reportedUser{trustScore=newScore})
ReportSvc -> ReportRepo : SessionReport.create(...)\n{appliedTrustDelta=actualDelta}\n→ save

== ⚠️ CURRENT BUG: Immediate AI Training (Task 2.2) ==

ReportSvc -> AiSvcCurrent : trainWeightsFromReport(reporterId, reason)\n[@Async — fires immediately, before admin review]

note over AiSvcCurrent #FFE0E0
    ⚠️ CURRENT BEHAVIOR (Bug):
    Any user who submits a report immediately gets:
      weightBehavior += 0.10 (base)
      weightBehavior += 0.05 (if SAFETY_CONCERN or PARTNER_MISCONDUCT)
    Total: up to +0.15 per report.

    If admin later REJECTS the report:
    ✗ Trust delta on reported user IS reversed (see AdminReportCommandService)
    ✗ Reporter's weightBehavior bump is NEVER rolled back
    → Malicious reporter can abuse this to force
      weightBehavior → MAX_CAP (0.70) permanently
end note

AiSvcCurrent -> PrefRepo : findByUserId(reporterId)
PrefRepo --> AiSvcCurrent : MatchingPreference
AiSvcCurrent -> AiSvcCurrent : weightBehavior += 0.10\n(+0.05 if high severity reason)
AiSvcCurrent -> AiSvcCurrent : normalize()
AiSvcCurrent -> PrefRepo : save(updatedPreference)

ReportSvc --> Controller : SessionReport{reportId, createdAt}
Controller --> FERepo : 201 Created {reportId, createdAt}
FERepo --> VM : onSuccess
VM --> User : "Report submitted. Thank you."

== ✅ PROPOSED FIX: Defer AI Training to Admin Resolution ==

note over ReportSvc, AiSvcCurrent #E8F5E9
    PROPOSED FIX (Task 2.2):
    • Remove trainWeightsFromReport() call from submitReport()
    • Move it to AdminReportCommandService.resolveReport()

    On APPROVED: fire trainWeightsFromReport() → weights update
    On REJECTED: no weight change (reporter stays clean)

    This makes AI training symmetric with trust reversal:
    both are now gated behind admin resolution.
end note

@enduml
